# DeptFlow V2: System & Logical Architecture

---

## 1. High-Level System Architecture (4-Layer Model)

DeptFlow V2 is structured into four decoupled layers, isolating presentation, network transport, core algorithmic scheduling, and data persistence:

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph L1["Layer 1: Presentation (Browser Client)"]
        UI["Single Page Application (SPA)<br/>HTML5 • CSS3 Matte Emerald • Vanilla JS"]
        State["Client State & Dynamic DOM<br/>Timetable Grid, Modals, Dependency Visualizer"]
        UI <--> State
    end

    subgraph L2["Layer 2: Communication (HTTP Server)"]
        WS["Winsock2 TCP Socket Server<br/>Port 8080 (Non-blocking I/O Loop)"]
        Router["HTTP REST Router & Serializer<br/>GET / POST / PUT / DELETE"]
        WS <--> Router
    end

    subgraph L3["Layer 3: Core DSA & Scheduling Engine"]
        Scheduler["7-Constraint Scheduling Engine<br/>Greedy Slot Allocator"]
        Heap["Max-Heap Priority Queue<br/>Weight: Practicals (100/110) > Theory (30/55)"]
        GraphDSA["Division Dependency Graph + BFS<br/>Direct (Shared Faculty) vs Indirect Ripple"]
        HashDSA["17-Bucket Hash Table<br/>Polynomial Rolling Hash for Faculty O(1)"]
        StackDSA["Undo Stack (LIFO)<br/>Atomic Session Edit Rollback"]
        Grid3D["3D Occupancy Grid<br/>grid[division][day][slot]"]

        Scheduler --> Heap
        Scheduler --> Grid3D
        Scheduler --> GraphDSA
        Scheduler --> HashDSA
        Scheduler --> StackDSA
    end

    subgraph L4["Layer 4: Storage & Persistence"]
        FileIO["File I/O Stream Manager<br/>Line-by-line Plaintext Serialization"]
        DataFiles[("data/*.txt Storage<br/>department, faculty, subjects, rooms, breaks, timetables")]
        FileIO <--> DataFiles
    end

    State <== "REST JSON / HTTP (Fetch API)" ==> WS
    Router <== "C++ Function Dispatch" ==> Scheduler
    Scheduler <== "Data Sync / Backup" ==> FileIO
```

